+/**
+ * Parity of the allocation-free slope search in BlockFlowing against a verbatim copy of the old implementation
+ * (EnumSet + Iterator + BlockPosition per probe), over randomized terrain in the overworld and nether, for water and
+ * lava. Also pins the coordinate-based canFlowTo to the old Bukkit-side chunk-loaded check.
+ */
+public class BlockFlowingParityTest {
